{
  "repo": 1,
  "name": "auth-kit",
  "what": "無函式庫的驗證原語 — PBKDF2 密碼雜湊 + HMAC-SHA256 JWT。零依賴、timing-safe、擋 alg 混淆。不用 bcrypt/jsonwebtoken。",
  "kind": "kit",
  "work": {
    "guide": "README.md",
    "test": "npm test"
  },
  "offers": [
    {
      "id": "create_auth",
      "what": "自己發 session 用：傳入私有 secret，回傳 hashPassword / verifyPassword / signJWT / verifyJWT / tokenFromRequest 五個函式。只驗自己發的 session，別拿去驗外部 IdP（LetMeUse / Auth0 / Clerk）的 token，那個用 jwks-verify-kit。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const auth = require('auth-kit')({ secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET })"
    },
    {
      "id": "hash_password",
      "what": "auth.hashPassword(pw) 用 PBKDF2 產生 \"salt:hash\" 存進 DB；auth.verifyPassword(pw, stored) 做 constant-time 比對，永不 throw。註冊登入要安全存密碼、又不想裝 bcrypt 時用。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const auth = require('auth-kit')({ secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET })"
    },
    {
      "id": "session_jwt",
      "what": "auth.signJWT(payload, expiresInMs?) 發 HS256 無狀態 token（預設 7 天）；auth.verifyJWT(token) 驗簽章、alg、到期，回 payload 或 null，永不 throw。注意 iat/exp 單位是毫秒不是秒，第三方函式庫讀不對。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const auth = require('auth-kit')({ secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET })"
    },
    {
      "id": "token_from_request",
      "what": "auth.tokenFromRequest(req, cookieName?) 從 Authorization: Bearer 或指定 cookie 取出 token，取不到回 null。每個請求驗 session 前先用它拿 token。",
      "how": "import",
      "import": "const auth = require('auth-kit')({ secret: process.env.JWT_SECRET })"
    },
    {
      "id": "skill",
      "what": "專案要自己做註冊登入、存密碼、發 session token 時載入的打法（何時觸發、接線、地雷）。",
      "how": "skill",
      "skill": "auth-kit"
    }
  ]
}
